--[[
    Cinis AI - standalone AI chat interface for Roblox executors (Delta / Arceus X)
    Three parts only: collapsible Sidebar | Main Chat | Settings overlay

    - Themes: "Moonlight" (dark) and "Sunset" (light), toggle in Settings, choice saved
    - Providers: OpenAI, Google DeepMind, Anthropic, Custom (OpenAI-compatible)
    - Every model list is user-maintained in Settings; API keys are stored locally
    - Uses writefile/readfile when available, otherwise keeps everything in memory
    - UI parents to gethui() > CoreGui > PlayerGui, each step guarded
]]

